  "worked_solution": "Using the quotient rule, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)})=\\frac{{f}^{\u2032}(x)g(x)-f(x){g}^{\u2032}(x)}{(g(x))^{2}}.\n$$\n\nAt the point where $x=4,$ this gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\frac{f(x)}{g(x)})|}_{x=4} & =\\frac{{f}^{\u2032}(4)g(4)-f(4){g}^{\u2032}(4)}{(g(4))^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{2}-2\\cdot (-1)}{(\\sqrt{2})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2+2}{2} \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
